{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build a cel-shaded tank arena game around Combat’s ricochet shots, maze duels, and quick rounds, with solo, local versus, and online play. I’ll keep the final game in one HTML file and test the full match flow, controller input, touch controls, and multiplayer.\n"}}
