{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The random title draw picked **ComBop**. The game will use an elevated arena view, chunky ink-outlined tanks, and three match variants: ricochet, cloaking, and a sudden-death finale. I’m using the local game-toolchain skill for the procedural art and audio workflow, and reading the supplied AI Hub integration code directly without web research.\n"}}
