{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The visual direction is a tabletop firing range: cream paper, teal and vermilion tanks, heavy ink edges, and destructible cover. The controls stay simple—move, aim, fire, and burst—with cloaking and overdrive introduced across the circuit. The procedural audio is built, and offline audio tests passed for the music, effects, and gibberish voices.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > ComBop-Combat-1977-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212552/index.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<!-- HUB_CLIENT -->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f4eedc\">\n<meta name=\"aihub\" content='\"'{\\\"name\\\":\\\"ComBop\\\",\\\"tagline\\\":\\\"Small tanks. Big comebacks.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Game\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"Shooter\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"Combat (1977)\\\",\\\"players\\\":\\\"1–2\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"1.0.0\\\"}'>\n<title>ComBop · Small tanks. Big comebacks.</title>\n<style>/* STYLES */</style>\n<script type=\\\"importmap\\\">{\\\"imports\\\":{\\\"three\\\":\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/build/three.webgpu.js\\\",\\\"three/webgpu\\\":\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/build/three.webgpu.js\\\",\\\"three/tsl\\\":\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/build/three.tsl.js\\\"}}</script>\n</head><body>\n<canvas id=\\\"world\\\" aria-label=\\\"ComBop tank arena\\\"></canvas><div id=\\\"paper-grain\\\"></div><div id=\\\"vignette\\\"></div>\n<div id=\\\"loading\\\"><div class=\\\"error-copy\\\"><div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\" style=\\\"justify-content:center\\\">Loading the little big guns</div><h1 class=\\\"title-logo\\\">Com<span>Bop</span></h1><div class=\\\"loader-track\\\"><div></div></div><p id=\\\"loading-detail\\\">Warming up the ricochets…</p></div></div>\n<div id=\\\"title-screen\\\" class=\\\"screen\\\"><div id=\\\"title-menu\\\"><div class=\\\"edition\\\">A pocket-sized armoured rumble / 1977 ↗ now</div><h1 class=\\\"title-logo\\\">Com<span>Bop</span></h1><p class=\\\"tagline\\\">Small tanks.<br>Big comebacks.</p><nav class=\\\"title-nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Main menu\\\"><button id=\\\"start-solo\\\" class=\\\"btn primary\\\" data-action=\\\"solo\\\">Solo circuit <span>↗</span></button><button id=\\\"start-local\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"local\\\">Couch duel <span>02</span></button><button id=\\\"start-online\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"online\\\">Online duel <span>◎</span></button></nav><nav class=\\\"small-nav\\\"><button id=\\\"guide-button\\\" class=\\\"btn link\\\" data-action=\\\"guide\\\">Field guide</button><button id=\\\"settings-button\\\" class=\\\"btn link\\\" data-action=\\\"settings\\\">Settings</button><button id=\\\"about-button\\\" class=\\\"btn link\\\" data-action=\\\"about\\\">About</button></nav></div><div class=\\\"arena-note\\\"><span class=\\\"stamp\\\">NO QUARTER REQUIRED</span><br><strong>BANK ON A COMEBACK.</strong><p>Three arenas. Three ways to outfox a tank.<br>Take the shot around the corner.</p></div><span class=\\\"corner top-right\\\">INK & ARMOUR DIVISION<br><span style=\\\"color:var(--teal)\\\">FIELD TEST Nº 077</span></span><span class=\\\"corner bottom-left\\\" id=\\\"title-prompt\\\">WASD + mouse · Controller ready</span><span class=\\\"corner bottom-right\\\">A little friendly fire.</span></div>\n<div id=\\\"hud\\\"><div class=\\\"scorebar\\\"><div class=\\\"player-card\\\"><div class=\\\"player-head\\\"><span class=\\\"player-name\\\" id=\\\"name-0\\\">YOU / TEAL</span><span class=\\\"score\\\" id=\\\"score-0\\\">0</span></div><div class=\\\"armor-row\\\" id=\\\"armor-0\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\"stage-card\\\"><div class=\\\"stage-name\\\" id=\\\"stage-name\\\">Bankshot boogie</div><div class=\\\"stage-sub\\\" id=\\\"stage-sub\\\">01 / 03 · FIRST TO 3</div><div id=\\\"timer\\\" class=\\\"timer\\\">1:30</div></div><div class=\\\"player-card coral\\\"><div class=\\\"player-head\\\"><span class=\\\"player-name\\\" id=\\\"name-1\\\">RIVAL / CORAL</span><span class=\\\"score\\\" id=\\\"score-1\\\">0</span></div><div class=\\\"armor-row\\\" id=\\\"armor-1\\\"></div></div></div><div id=\\\"combat-help\\\"><span><span class=\\\"prompt\\\" data-prompt=\\\"move\\\">WASD</span> Move</span><span><span class=\\\"prompt\\\" data-prompt=\\\"aim\\\">Mouse</span> Aim</span><span><span class=\\\"prompt\\\" data-prompt=\\\"fire\\\">LMB</span> Fire</span><span><span class=\\\"prompt\\\" data-prompt=\\\"dash\\\">Space</span> Burst <span class=\\\"ability-meter\\\"><i id=\\\"dash-meter\\\"></i></span></span></div><button id=\\\"pause-button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Pause\\\" data-action=\\\"pause\\\">Ⅱ</button></div>\n<div id=\\\"announce\\\"></div><div id=\\\"toast\\\" role=\\\"status\\\"></div><div id=\\\"attract-bar\\\"><strong>Automatic armoured nonsense</strong>DEMO IN PROGRESS · ANY INPUT TO RETURN</div><div id=\\\"touch-ring\\\"></div><button id=\\\"dash-touch\\\" class=\\\"touch-button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Burst\\\">BURST ↗</button>\n<div id=\\\"pause-screen\\\" class=\\\"screen overlay\\\"><section class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"width:min(560px,90vw)\\\"><div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Pit stop</div><h2>Hold that thought.</h2><p class=\\\"subtle\\\" id=\\\"pause-copy\\\">Your tank can catch its breath.</p><div class=\\\"separator\\\"></div><div class=\\\"stack\\\"><button id=\\\"resume\\\" class=\\\"btn primary\\\" data-action=\\\"resume\\\">Back to the rumble <span>↗</span></button><button class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"settings\\\">Settings</button><button class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"guide\\\">Field guide</button><button id=\\\"dev-button\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"dev\\\">Dev workshop <span>⚙</span></button><button class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"title\\\">Return to title</button></div></section></div>\n<div id=\\\"settings-screen\\\" class=\\\"screen overlay\\\"><section class=\\\"panel\\\"><div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Tune the machine</div><h2>Just your speed.</h2><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"music-volume\\\">Music</label><small>Procedural pocket-sized funk</small></div><div class=\\\"range-wrap\\\"><input id=\\\"music-volume\\\" type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"100\\\" value=\\\"10\\\"><output id=\\\"music-value\\\">10%</output></div></div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"sfx-volume\\\">Effects & voices</label><small>Rumbles, ricochets, and radio gibberish</small></div><div class=\\\"range-wrap\\\"><input id=\\\"sfx-volume\\\" type=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"100\\\" value=\\\"70\\\"><output id=\\\"sfx-value\\\">70%</output></div></div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"glyph-style\\\">Controller prompts</label><small>Standard mapped controllers supported</small></div><select id=\\\"glyph-style\\\"><option value=\\\"ps\\\">PlayStation · △ ○ × □</option><option value=\\\"xbox\\\">Xbox · A B X Y</option></select></div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"assist\\\">Aim guide</label><small>See your next two ricochets</small></div><select id=\\\"assist\\\"><option value=\\\"on\\\">On</option><option value=\\\"off\\\">Off</option></select></div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"arena-select\\\">Duel arena</label><small>For couch and standalone online play</small></div><select id=\\\"arena-select\\\"><option value=\\\"0\\\">01 · Bankshot boogie</option><option value=\\\"1\\\">02 · Ghost shift</option><option value=\\\"2\\\">03 · Double time</option></select></div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><div><label for=\\\"shake\\\">Screen shake</label><small>Keep your paper steady</small></div><select id=\\\"shake\\\"><option value=\\\"on\\\">On</option><option value=\\\"off\\\">Off</option></select></div><div class=\\\"back-row\\\"><button class=\\\"btn\\\" data-action=\\\"back\\\">← Back</button><button class=\\\"btn link\\\" data-action=\\\"reset-settings\\\">Restore defaults</button></div></section></div>\n<div id=\\\"guide-screen\\\" class=\\\"screen overlay\\\"><section class=\\\"panel\\\"><div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Field guide / 4 useful things</div><h2>Aim. Bop. Repeat.</h2><div class=\\\"guide-grid\\\"><article class=\\\"guide-card\\\"><div class=\\\"guide-number\\\">01</div><h3>A wall is an opportunity.</h3><p>Shells bounce twice. Angle a shot around cover. The dotted guide shows the way. Three hits wreck a tank; three wrecks win the bout.</p></article><article class=\\\"guide-card\\\"><div class=\\\"guide-number\\\">02</div><h3>Save a little burst.</h3><p>Burst to dodge or slip through a gap. It recharges in three seconds. Three shell slots refill automatically. Your own bounces can hurt you\"'!</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-number\">03</div><h3>Things get peculiar.</h3><p>Ghost shift: tanks fade until they fire or get hit. Double time: collect the lightning for rapid fire. Green crosses repair armour.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-number\">04</div><h3>Make a little room.</h3><p>Gold crates break. Red fuel cans explode. At zero time, the hot zone closes in: keep moving. Complete three bouts to take the circuit.</p></article></div><div class=\"guide-controls desktop-tip\"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> WASD move · Mouse aim · Click fire · Space burst · Esc pause<br><strong>Controller:</strong> Left stick move · Right stick aim · R2 fire · ○ / L2 burst<br><strong>Couch player 2:</strong> Arrows move · IJKL aim · Enter fire · Shift burst</div><div class=\"guide-controls touch-tip\"><strong>Touch:</strong> Drag anywhere on the left to drive. The gun aims and fires for you. Drag on the right to take over the gun. Tap BURST to dodge. Use landscape for a wider view.</div><div class=\"back-row\"><button class=\"btn\" data-action=\"back\">← Back</button><span class=\"hint\">Couch duel: one keyboard or two pads.</span></div></section></div>\n<div id=\"dev-screen\" class=\"screen overlay\"><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Dev workshop / live balance</div><h2>Twist a few knobs.</h2><div id=\"dev-sliders\"></div><div class=\"row wrap\" style=\"margin-top:22px\"><button class=\"btn small\" data-action=\"dev-god\" id=\"dev-god\">Invulnerable: off</button><button class=\"btn small\" data-action=\"dev-next\">Wi