dth:min(660px,92vw)\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"roundover-kicker\">Bout complete</div><h2 id=\"roundover-title\">Well bopped.</h2><p class=\"subtle\" id=\"roundover-copy\">One down. Keep the good angles coming.</p><div class=\"result-score\" id=\"roundover-score\">3 : <span>1</span></div><div class=\"row wrap\"><button id=\"next-round\" class=\"btn primary\" data-action=\"next-round\">Next arena <span>↗</span></button><button class=\"btn\" data-action=\"title\">Return to title</button></div></section></div>\n<div id=\"results-screen\" class=\"screen overlay\"><section class=\"panel\" style=\"width:min(730px,92vw)\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Circuit complete / all angles covered</div><h2>Certified troublemaker.</h2><p>You came. You saw. You ricocheted.<br>Three arenas, one very small champion.</p><div class=\"medals\"><div class=\"medal\"><b>↝</b>BANKSHOT BOOGIE</div><div class=\"medal\"><b>◎</b>GHOST SHIFT</div><div class=\"medal\"><b>ϟ</b>DOUBLE TIME</div></div><p class=\"subtle\" id=\"results-stats\"></p><div class=\"back-row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" data-action=\"solo\">One more circuit <span>↗</span></button><button class=\"btn\" data-action=\"title\">Title</button><button class=\"btn link\" data-action=\"about\">Credits</button></div></section></div>\n<div id=\"about-screen\" class=\"screen overlay\"><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Ink & armour / the fine print</div><h2>Made of little things.</h2><nav class=\"credits-tabs\"><button class=\"btn small\" data-credit=\"sourceInformation\">Source information</button><button class=\"btn small\" data-credit=\"testingFeedback\">Testing feedback</button><button class=\"btn small\" data-credit=\"engineFeedback\">Engine feedback</button><button class=\"btn small\" data-credit=\"promptFeedback\">Prompt feedback</button></nav><div class=\"credits-body\" id=\"credits-body\"></div><div class=\"back-row\"><button class=\"btn\" data-action=\"back\">← Back</button><span class=\"hint\">Original procedural ar