{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"agent_message","text":"The visuals are working well in review, and all four AI Hub harness scenarios passed their protocol checks. A separate graphics issue also reproduced in a minimal Three.js scene: Chromium’s suggested software-WebGPU flags were losing the GPU device. An alternate flag combination is stable in that small test; I’m verifying the full game with it now.\n"}}
